Reproduce with:

  curl -O https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/unifont/unifont-16.0.04/unifont_all-16.0.04.hex.gz
  gunzip unifont_all-16.0.04.hex.gz
  cargo run --manifest-path td-compositor/Cargo.toml \
      --bin td-term-import-unifont -- unifont_all-16.0.04.hex td-compositor/src

License
-------

Unifont's font files are dual-licensed, per the upstream COPYING committed
beside this file: SIL Open Font License version 1.1, and GNU GPL version 2 or
later with the GNU font embedding exception. td takes the OFL 1.1 arm.

COPYING carves out font/plane00/jiskan16-plane00.hex and
font/plane02/jiskan16-plane02.hex, which are Public Domain rather than
dual-licensed. Both are 16x16, so this single-width face excludes them by
construction rather than by choice -- the importer skips every double-width
record, and no glyph here comes from either file.
